WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.607
Video 9. GST saathe sales invoice, ane eni
print.

00:00:05.807 --> 00:00:10.217
Ek sales invoice darek rakam ena ledger ma
mokle chhe.

00:00:10.147 --> 00:00:15.245
Sharma Traders tamne ₹53,025 aapvana chhe.

00:00:15.176 --> 00:00:19.149
₹50,500 Sales Account ma jaay chhe.

00:00:19.078 --> 00:00:28.011
Tax CGST ane SGST ma jaay chhe, adadho adadho.
Tamaru GST return tyaathi le chhe.

00:00:28.311 --> 00:00:36.542
V dabavo to vouchers khule chhe. F8 etle
Sales. E Item Invoice mode ma khule chhe.

00:00:36.572 --> 00:00:43.205
Party pasand karo, Sharma Traders, ane sales
ledger. Place of Supply Gujarat chhe.

00:00:44.285 --> 00:00:49.359
"cotton" lakho, ane Enter dabavo. Hisaab
godown puchhe chhe.

00:00:49.389 --> 00:00:54.261
Ring Road Warehouse: 100 metres, ₹180 na
bhaave.

00:00:54.961 --> 00:01:03.074
End of List par Enter. Line ma ₹18,000 dekhay
chhe, 5% GST saathe.

00:01:03.104 --> 00:01:10.701
Biji item maate aagli line par click karo:
silk, 50 metres, ₹650 na bhaave.

00:01:12.452 --> 00:01:15.701
Items ni niche, tax ledgers pasand karo.

00:01:15.731 --> 00:01:24.354
CGST, pachhi SGST. Hisaab darek gane chhe:
₹1,262.50.

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:31.976
Narration lakho. Kul rakam ₹53,025 chhe.
Hisaab puchhe chhe: Accept?

00:01:33.056 --> 00:01:40.244
Yes maate Y. Have bill-wise details: New Ref,
bill 1, 30 divas ma due.

00:01:40.274 --> 00:01:43.241
Ctrl+A thi invoice save thay chhe.

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:47.958
Page Up dabavo to invoice fari khule chhe.

00:01:47.988 --> 00:01:57.200
Ctrl+P thi print preview dekhay chhe: banne GSTIN, HSN
codes, ane shabdo ma rakam saathe Tax Invoice.

00:01:57.230 --> 00:02:07.206
P thi print. Windows app ma, print window preview batave
chhe. Tya printer pasand karo, ke Save as PDF.

00:02:07.686 --> 00:02:10.765
Ek invoice: ₹53,025.

00:02:10.695 --> 00:02:14.957
Emaathi ₹2,525 GST chhe.

00:02:15.157 --> 00:02:18.878
Have pachhi: bija state maathi purchase, ane
bills.

